---
layout: base.njk
title: Education
description: "Education and certificates of Kristiina Martin: MSc Electrical Power Engineering and BSc Thermal Power Engineering at TalTech, CSRD and EU Taxonomy training."
---
<h1 class="page-title">Education</h1>

{%- for e in education.degrees %}
<article class="edu-item">
  <h2 class="edu-title">{{ e.title }}</h2>
  <p class="edu-meta">{{ e.where }}, {{ e.years }}</p>
  {%- if e.text %}
  <p>{{ e.text }}</p>
  {%- endif %}
</article>
{%- endfor %}

<h2 class="sub-title">Certificates and awards</h2>
<ul class="plainlist">
  {%- for c in education.certificates %}
  <li>{{ c }}</li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
